```

## Wi-Fi

```cpp
const char WIFI_SSID[] = "MinhaRede";
const char WIFI_SENHA[] = "MinhaSenha";
```

## MQTT

```cpp
const char MQTT_BROKER[] = "broker.exemplo.com";
const uint16_t MQTT_PORTA = 1883;

const char MQTT_CLIENT_ID[] = "esp32_tela";
```

